translate catalan strings:

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1421
    old "{color=#D9D9D9}{size=72}CONTENT WARNING{/size}\n\n\n{size=48}This is a horror game, and is not intended for all audiences. Please visit our website www.blacktabbygames.com if you need a list of specific content warnings.{/size}\n\n\n{size=48}Slay the Princess contains flickering image effects as well as a parallax effect that on rare occasions has caused motion sickness in players.{/size}\n\n\n{size=48}If either of these effects cause health issues for you, you can disable them in the game's preferences.{/size}{/color}"
    new "{color=#D9D9D9}{size=72}AVÍS DE CONTINGUT{/size}\n\n\n{size=48}Aquest és un joc de por, i no està fet per a tots els públics. Sisplau, visiteu la nostra pàgina web www.blacktabbygames.com si necessiteu una llista d'avisos de contingut específics.{/size}\n\n\n{size=48}Slay the princess conté efectes d'imatge pampallugants així com un efecte paral·laxi que, en rares ocasions, ha causat cinetosi o mareig en jugadors.{/size}\n\n\n{size=48}Si alguns d'aquests efectes et causen problemes de salut, els pots desactivar en les preferencies del joc.{/size}{/color}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1430
    old "{color=#D9D9D9}{size=56}Whatever horrors you may find in these dark spaces,\nhave heart and see them through.{/size}\n\n\n{size=46}There are no premature endings. There are no wrong decisions.\n\n\nThere are only fresh perspectives and new beginnings.{/size}\n\n\n\n{size=64}This is a love story.{/size}{/color}"
    new "{color=#D9D9D9}{size=56}Siguin quins siguin els horrors que poguis trobar en aquests espais foscos, \nhas de tenir coratge i seguir endavant.{/size}\n\n\n{size=46}No hi ha finals prematurs. No hi ha males decisions.\n\n\nTan sols hi ha perspectives fresques i nous principis.{/size}\n\n\n\n{size=64}Aquesta és una història d'amor.{/size}{/color}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1477
    old "{color=#FFFFFF00}Chapter One. The Hero and the Princess.{/color}"
    new "{color=#FFFFFF00}Capitol U. L'Heroi i la Princesa.{/color}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) The end of the world? What are you talking about?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) La fi del món? De que estàs parlant?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) But how can a princess locked away in a basement end the world?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Però com vols que una princesa tancada en un subterrani provoqui la fi del món?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) If you don't tell me why she's dangerous, I'm not going to kill her.{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Si no em dius perquè és perillosa, no la mataré.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Okay. What happens if she gets out then? I want specifics.{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Molt bé. Que passa si surt, doncs? Vull detalls.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Do you have any evidence to back this up?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Tens alguna manera de demostrar-ho?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Have you considered that maybe the only reason she's going to end the world is {b}because{/b} she's locked up?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Has tingut en compte que potser l'únic motiu pel qual pravocarà la fi del món és {b}perquè{/b} està tancada?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Killing a princess seems kind of bad, though, doesn't it?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Matar una princesa sona bastant malament, però, oi?"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Can't someone else do this?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) No ho pot fer algú altre, aixó?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Forget it, I'm not doing this.{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Ja te'n pots oblidar, jo aixó no ho faig.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Have you considered that maybe I'm okay with the world ending?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Has tingut en compte que potser ja m'estigui bé que s'acabi el món?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Do I get some sort of reward for doing this?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) Tindré alguna mena de recompensa per fer-ho?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• (Explore) Can you tell me what my prize is going to be for doing a good job?{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) No em pots dir quin és el meu premi per fer una bona feina?{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• Look, I'll go to the cabin and I'll talk to her, and if she's as bad as you say she is then {b}maybe{/b} I'll slay her. But I'm not committing to anything until I've had the chance to meet her face to face.{/i}"
    new "{i}• Mira, aniré al la cabanya i hi parlaré, i si és tant dolenta com dius doncs {b}potser{/b} li dongui mort. Però no prometo res fins que no l'hagi pogut conéixer cara a cara.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• Okay. Fine. I'll go to the cabin.{/i}"
    new "{i}• Molt bé, d'acord. Aniré a la cabanya"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• Okay, I'm sold. Let's get this over with.{/i}"
    new "{i}• Molt bé, m'has covençut. Acabem amb aixó.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• Oh, okay. Thanks for telling me what to do.{/i}"
    new "{i}• Ah, molt bé. Gràcies per dir-me que fer.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• Sweet! I've always wanted to off a monarch. Viva la revolución!{/i}"
    new "{i}• Que bé! Sempre he volgut enderrocar un monarca. Viva la revolución!{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1586
    old "{i}• [[Silently continue to the cabin.]{/i}"
    new "{i}• [[Caminar sense dir res envers la cabanya.]{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• Okay, fine. You're persistent. I'll go to the cabin and I'll slay the Princess. Ugh!{/i}"
    new "{i}• Molt bé, d'acord. Ets persistent. Aniré a la cabanya i donaré mort a la princesa. Uf!{/i}

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• Okay, fine. I'll go to the cabin and I'll talk to the Princess. Maybe I'll slay her. Maybe I won't. I guess we'll see.{/i}"
    new "{i}• Molt bé, d'acord. Aniré a la cabanya i parlaré amb la princesa. Potser li donaré mort. Potser no. Ja veurem, suposo./i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• (Lie) Yes, I definitely know where I'm going.{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Mentint) Sí, sé perfectament on vaig.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• Nope!{/i}"
    new "{i}• Nop!{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• The only thing that matters is where I'm not going. (The cabin. I am not going to the cabin.){/i}"
    new "{i}• L'única cosa que importa és on no vaig. (La cabanya. No vaig a la cabanya.){/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• It's like I said, I'm pretty okay with the world ending. I relish the coming of a new dawn beyond our own.{/i}"
    new "{i}• Tal i com ja he dit, ja em sembla bé que el mon s'acabi. M'agrada la idea d'un nou començament, més enllà dels nostres temps.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• I'm actually pretty okay with the world ending. I relish the coming of a new dawn beyond our own. Gonna go walk in the opposite direction now!{/i}"
    new "{i}• En realitat, ja em sembla bé que el mon s'acabi. M'agrada la idea d'un nou començament, més enllà dels nostres temps. Cap a l'altra direcció que vaig!{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1724
    old "{i}• [[Quietly continue down the path away from the cabin.]{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1877
    old "{i}• Okay, okay! I'm going into the cabin. Sheesh.{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1877
    old "{i}• [[Turn around (again) and leave (again.)]{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1933
    old "{i}• I don't care! I'm not killing a princess!{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1933
    old "{i}• Good! Maybe everyone {b}should{/b} die! It's what they get for dumping me in the woods and asking me to {b}kill{/b} someone for them.{/i}"
    new "{i}• Molt bé doncs! Potser sí que tothom {b}hauria de{/b} morir. Ja els està bé, per tirar-me al mig del bosc i demanar-me que els hi {b}mati{/b} algú.{/i}"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1933
    old "{i}• You're not emotionally blackmailing me into doing this!{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:1933
    old "{i}• [[Quietly continue down the path.]{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:2016
    old "{i}• There's no fighting this, is there? I have to go into the cabin, don't I? Fine.{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:2016
    old "{i}• Oh, yeah? Well I guess I start walking in a different direction. Again. In fact, I'm going to just keep trekking through the wilderness until I find a way out of this place.{/i}"
    new "{i}• "

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:2210
    old "{i}• (Explore) [[Take the blade.]{/i}"
    new "{i}• (Explorar) [[Prendre la daga]"

    # game/scripts/ch_1/script.rpy:2210
    old "{i}• [[Enter the basement.]{/i}"
    new "{i}• [[Entrar al subterrani]"

